INSERT INTO `discovery_pages` VALUES (1,'/fresh-flowers','collection','Fresh Flowers in Hyderabad','<p>Explore Manidvipa Flowers by flower name, colour and traditional use. Every sellable flower has one permanent detail URL, while this page helps customers browse the full fresh-flower range.</p>','Fresh Flowers Online in Hyderabad | Manidvipa Flowers','Shop fresh flowers in Hyderabad for pooja, garlands, temple offerings and traditional functions. Browse lotus, chamanthi, sampangi, jasmine and more.','fresh flowers in Hyderabad','fresh flowers; Manidvipa Flowers; Hyderabad flower delivery','https://www.manidvipaflowers.com/fresh-flowers','index,follow',1,1,1,'2026-09-25 18:02:57','2026-09-25 18:02:57'),(2,'/pooja-flowers','collection','Fresh Pooja Flowers in Hyderabad','<p>Find flowers commonly chosen for daily pooja, temple offerings and traditional occasions. Use this as an intent-based landing page, not a second copy of individual flower pages.</p>','Pooja Flowers Online in Hyderabad | Manidvipa Flowers','Order fresh pooja flowers in Hyderabad including lotus, chamanthi, sampangi, jasmine, roses, mandaram and traditional flower varieties.','pooja flowers in Hyderabad','pooja flowers; Manidvipa Flowers; Hyderabad flower delivery','https://www.manidvipaflowers.com/pooja-flowers','index,follow',1,1,2,'2026-09-25 18:02:57','2026-09-25 18:02:57'),(3,'/lotus-flowers','collection','White & Pink Lotus Flowers in Hyderabad','<p>Choose between White Lotus and Pink Lotus. Each colour has its own flower page, image, stock and ordering information.</p>','Lotus Flowers Hyderabad | White & Pink Lotus for Pooja','Shop fresh White Lotus and Pink Lotus flowers in Hyderabad for pooja and temple offerings. Compare colours and check daily availability.','lotus flowers in Hyderabad','lotus flowers; Manidvipa Flowers; Hyderabad flower delivery','https://www.manidvipaflowers.com/lotus-flowers','index,follow',1,1,3,'2026-09-25 18:02:57','2026-09-25 18:02:57'),(4,'/chamanthi-flowers','collection','Chamanthi Flowers in Hyderabad','<p>Browse colour-specific Chamanthi varieties without creating duplicate category/item URLs. Yellow, Pink, Violet and Red Chamanthi each remain independently searchable.</p>','Chamanthi Flowers Hyderabad | Yellow, Pink, Violet & Red','Shop fresh Chamanthi flowers in Hyderabad in yellow, pink, violet and red. Find pooja and floral-use options from Manidvipa Flowers.','chamanthi flowers in Hyderabad','chamanthi flowers; Manidvipa Flowers; Hyderabad flower delivery','https://www.manidvipaflowers.com/chamanthi-flowers','index,follow',1,1,4,'2026-09-25 18:02:57','2026-09-25 18:02:57'),(5,'/sampangi-flowers','collection','Sampangi Flowers in Hyderabad','<p>Compare Yellow Sampangi and Green Sampangi in one family page, then continue to the exact colour page for price, stock and pack sizes.</p>','Sampangi Flowers Hyderabad | Yellow & Green Sampangi','Order fresh Sampangi flowers in Hyderabad. Browse Yellow Sampangi and Green Sampangi for pooja, garlands and traditional floral use.','sampangi flowers in Hyderabad','sampangi flowers; Manidvipa Flowers; Hyderabad flower delivery','https://www.manidvipaflowers.com/sampangi-flowers','index,follow',1,1,5,'2026-09-25 18:02:57','2026-09-25 18:02:57'),(6,'/rose-flowers','collection','Fresh Roses for Pooja in Hyderabad','<p>A focused rose collection for pooja and traditional floral use, separate from generic bouquet or gifting intent.</p>','Roses for Pooja Hyderabad | Button Roses & Mixed Roses','Shop Button Roses and Mixed Roses in Hyderabad for pooja, petals, garlands and traditional flower decoration.','roses for pooja in Hyderabad','roses for pooja; Manidvipa Flowers; Hyderabad flower delivery','https://www.manidvipaflowers.com/rose-flowers','index,follow',1,1,6,'2026-09-25 18:02:57','2026-09-25 18:02:57'),(7,'/jasmine-flowers','collection','Jasmine & Sannajaji Flowers in Hyderabad','<p>Local search names matter. Jasmine, Malli and Mallelu resolve to the Jasmine page, while Sannajaji keeps its own detail page because customers search for it separately.</p>','Jasmine Flowers Hyderabad | Malli, Mallelu & Sannajaji','Order fresh Jasmine, Malli, Mallelu and Sannajaji flowers in Hyderabad for pooja, garlands and traditional occasions.','jasmine flowers in Hyderabad','jasmine flowers; Manidvipa Flowers; Hyderabad flower delivery','https://www.manidvipaflowers.com/jasmine-flowers','index,follow',1,1,7,'2026-09-25 18:02:57','2026-09-25 18:02:57'),(8,'/traditional-pooja-flowers','collection','Traditional Pooja Flowers in Hyderabad','<p>A browse page for traditional varieties that may not fit a large colour-family category but still deserve their own rich flower pages.</p>','Traditional Pooja Flowers Hyderabad | Manidvipa Flowers','Shop Red Mandaram, Pooja Lilies, Nandivardhanam and Pink Arali in Hyderabad for traditional pooja and ceremonial floral use.','traditional pooja flowers in Hyderabad','traditional pooja flowers; Manidvipa Flowers; Hyderabad flower delivery','https://www.manidvipaflowers.com/traditional-pooja-flowers','index,follow',1,1,8,'2026-09-25 18:02:57','2026-09-25 18:02:57'),(9,'/pooja-leaves','collection','Fresh Pooja Leaves in Hyderabad','<p>Browse fresh leaves for traditional pooja requirements. Local names such as Tamalapakulu, Bilva and Arati Akulu are mapped to one canonical item each.</p>','Pooja Leaves Hyderabad | Tulasi, Maredu, Betel & More','Order fresh pooja leaves in Hyderabad including Betel Leaves, Tulasi Patri, Maredu Patri and Arati Akulu from Manidvipa Flowers.','pooja leaves in Hyderabad','pooja leaves; Manidvipa Flowers; Hyderabad flower delivery','https://www.manidvipaflowers.com/pooja-leaves','index,follow',1,1,9,'2026-09-25 18:02:57','2026-09-25 18:02:57'),(10,'/pooja-herbs','collection','Fresh Maruvam & Davanam in Hyderabad','<p>A simple collection for aromatic pooja greens, with Maruvam and Davanam each maintaining their own sellable page.</p>','Maruvam & Davanam Hyderabad | Fresh Pooja Herbs','Order fresh Maruvam and Davanam in Hyderabad for pooja, garlands and traditional flower combinations from Manidvipa Flowers.','maruvam davanam Hyderabad','maruvam davanam Hyderabad; Manidvipa Flowers; Hyderabad flower delivery','https://www.manidvipaflowers.com/pooja-herbs','index,follow',1,1,10,'2026-09-25 18:02:57','2026-09-25 18:02:57'),(11,'/banana-pooja-items','collection','Arati Padulu & Arati Akulu in Hyderabad','<p>Banana plants and banana leaves are different sellable items with different units, so they have separate detail pages and SKUs.</p>','Arati Padulu & Arati Akulu Hyderabad | Manidvipa','Order Arati Padulu and fresh Arati Akulu in Hyderabad for pooja, house functions and traditional ceremonial setups.','arati padulu arati akulu Hyderabad','arati padulu arati akulu Hyderabad; Manidvipa Flowers; Hyderabad flower delivery','https://www.manidvipaflowers.com/banana-pooja-items','index,follow',1,1,11,'2026-09-25 18:02:57','2026-09-25 18:02:57'),(12,'/pooja-essentials','collection','Fresh Pooja Flowers, Leaves & Traditional Essentials','<p>A broad navigation hub that connects flowers, leaves, herbs and ceremonial items without duplicating the content of individual item pages.</p>','Fresh Pooja Essentials Hyderabad | Manidvipa Flowers','Browse fresh pooja flowers, leaves, herbs and traditional floral essentials in Hyderabad from Manidvipa Flowers.','pooja essentials Hyderabad','pooja essentials Hyderabad; Manidvipa Flowers; Hyderabad flower delivery','https://www.manidvipaflowers.com/pooja-essentials','index,follow',1,1,12,'2026-09-25 18:02:57','2026-09-25 18:02:57'),(100,'/','home','Fresh Pooja Flowers, Traditional Flowers & Pooja Leaves in Hyderabad','<p>Manidvipa Flowers helps Hyderabad customers find fresh lotus, chamanthi, sampangi, jasmine, roses, traditional flowers, pooja leaves and aromatic greens through clear flower-first navigation.</p>','Fresh Pooja Flowers Online Hyderabad | Manidvipa Flowers','Order fresh pooja flowers, lotus, chamanthi, sampangi, jasmine, roses, pooja leaves and traditional flowers in Hyderabad from Manidvipa Flowers.','fresh pooja flowers Hyderabad','fresh flowers Hyderabad; pooja flowers online Hyderabad; temple flowers Hyderabad; pooja leaves Hyderabad','https://www.manidvipaflowers.com/','index,follow',1,1,1,'2026-09-25 18:02:57','2026-09-25 18:02:57');
/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `discovery_pages` ENABLE KEYS */;
