INSERT INTO `mf_item_faqs` VALUES (1,1,'Can I order White Lotus in Hyderabad?','Yes, when White Lotus is shown as available for your serviceable Hyderabad area. Fresh stock can change daily, so check the current status on this page before placing a time-sensitive order.',1,1),(2,1,'What other names are used for White Lotus?','Customers may also search for Tella Tamara, Lotus. Manidvipa Flowers keeps these as alternate search names on the same page instead of creating duplicate listings.',2,1),(3,1,'How is White Lotus sold?','White Lotus uses piece as its base selling unit in the catalog. The actual selectable pack sizes or counts should be shown only after Manidvipa Flowers configures the real selling options and prices.',3,1),(4,1,'How should I keep White Lotus fresh after delivery?','Keep the lotus cool, shaded and protected from pressure. Handle the petals gently and use the flower as fresh as possible after delivery.',4,1),(5,2,'Can I order Pink Lotus in Hyderabad?','Yes, when Pink Lotus is shown as available for your serviceable Hyderabad area. Fresh stock can change daily, so check the current status on this page before placing a time-sensitive order.',1,1),(6,2,'What other names are used for Pink Lotus?','Customers may also search for Gulabi Tamara, Lotus. Manidvipa Flowers keeps these as alternate search names on the same page instead of creating duplicate listings.',2,1),(7,2,'How is Pink Lotus sold?','Pink Lotus uses piece as its base selling unit in the catalog. The actual selectable pack sizes or counts should be shown only after Manidvipa Flowers configures the real selling options and prices.',3,1),(8,2,'How should I keep Pink Lotus fresh after delivery?','Keep the flower away from direct heat and crushing. Store it in a cool shaded place and handle the stem and petals gently.',4,1),(9,3,'Can I order Yellow Sampangi in Hyderabad?','Yes, when Yellow Sampangi is shown as available for your serviceable Hyderabad area. Fresh stock can change daily, so check the current status on this page before placing a time-sensitive order.',1,1),(10,3,'What other names are used for Yellow Sampangi?','Customers may also search for Sampangi Puvvu, Yellow Champak. Manidvipa Flowers keeps these as alternate search names on the same page instead of creating duplicate listings.',2,1),(11,3,'How is Yellow Sampangi sold?','Yellow Sampangi uses gram as its base selling unit in the catalog. The actual selectable pack sizes or counts should be shown only after Manidvipa Flowers configures the real selling options and prices.',3,1),(12,3,'How should I keep Yellow Sampangi fresh after delivery?','Keep the flowers cool and ventilated. Avoid leaving freshly packed sampangi in heat or in tightly sealed packaging for long periods.',4,1),(13,4,'Can I order Green Sampangi in Hyderabad?','Yes, when Green Sampangi is shown as available for your serviceable Hyderabad area. Fresh stock can change daily, so check the current status on this page before placing a time-sensitive order.',1,1),(14,4,'What other names are used for Green Sampangi?','Customers may also search for Pachha Sampangi, Sampangi. Manidvipa Flowers keeps these as alternate search names on the same page instead of creating duplicate listings.',2,1),(15,4,'How is Green Sampangi sold?','Green Sampangi uses gram as its base selling unit in the catalog. The actual selectable pack sizes or counts should be shown only after Manidvipa Flowers configures the real selling options and prices.',3,1),(16,4,'How should I keep Green Sampangi fresh after delivery?','Protect the flowers from direct sun and excessive heat. Keep them loosely packed so the blooms are not compressed.',4,1),(17,5,'Can I order Yellow Chamanthi in Hyderabad?','Yes, when Yellow Chamanthi is shown as available for your serviceable Hyderabad area. Fresh stock can change daily, so check the current status on this page before placing a time-sensitive order.',1,1),(18,5,'What other names are used for Yellow Chamanthi?','Customers may also search for Yellow Samanthi, Yellow Chrysanthemum. Manidvipa Flowers keeps these as alternate search names on the same page instead of creating duplicate listings.',2,1),(19,5,'How is Yellow Chamanthi sold?','Yellow Chamanthi uses gram as its base selling unit in the catalog. The actual selectable pack sizes or counts should be shown only after Manidvipa Flowers configures the real selling options and prices.',3,1),(20,5,'How should I keep Yellow Chamanthi fresh after delivery?','Store loose flowers in a cool shaded place. Use clean, breathable packing and avoid excess moisture or heavy pressure.',4,1),(21,6,'Can I order Pink Chamanthi in Hyderabad?','Yes, when Pink Chamanthi is shown as available for your serviceable Hyderabad area. Fresh stock can change daily, so check the current status on this page before placing a time-sensitive order.',1,1),(22,6,'What other names are used for Pink Chamanthi?','Customers may also search for Pink Samanthi, Pink Chrysanthemum. Manidvipa Flowers keeps these as alternate search names on the same page instead of creating duplicate listings.',2,1),(23,6,'How is Pink Chamanthi sold?','Pink Chamanthi uses gram as its base selling unit in the catalog. The actual selectable pack sizes or counts should be shown only after Manidvipa Flowers configures the real selling options and prices.',3,1),(24,6,'How should I keep Pink Chamanthi fresh after delivery?','Protect the blooms from crushing and heat. Keep the pack breathable and use the freshest stock first.',4,1),(25,7,'Can I order Violet Chamanthi in Hyderabad?','Yes, when Violet Chamanthi is shown as available for your serviceable Hyderabad area. Fresh stock can change daily, so check the current status on this page before placing a time-sensitive order.',1,1),(26,7,'What other names are used for Violet Chamanthi?','Customers may also search for Purple Chamanthi, Purple Samanthi, Violet Chrysanthemum. Manidvipa Flowers keeps these as alternate search names on the same page instea